Licence for benchmark data
==========================

This file covers the **data** in this repository, not the software. Specifically
it covers everything under `data/` and `curves/` — the raw benchmark
observations contributed by anyone who runs the harness, and the compression
curves fitted from them.

The software in this repository is licensed under the Apache License, Version
2.0; see LICENSE. Software licences do not cover data, which is why this split
exists.

